/T (The amount of rotation is selected using a 2-bit control signal sel. selOperation 00 ->No rotation 01 -> Rotate right by 1 10 ->Rotate right by 2 11->Rotate right by 3 The implementation uses a unique case statement to select the required rotation. The unique case statement informs both the simulator and synthesis tool that exactly one case item should match for every valid input. Compared to a normal case statement, unique case provides two benefits:)
